# clasp uploads .js/.gs/.ts/.html by default, which would send the vitest suite to Apps Script.
# Only the scripts and the manifest belong up there.
#
# ⚠️ THIS IS A WHITELIST, so a NEW .gs file is silently left behind. That has happened once:
# roster.gs was written, tested, committed and deployed, and the gateway answered `server_error`
# on every roster call because the function it named did not exist up there. `clasp push` says
# how many files it sent and lists them — it does not say what it skipped.
# `test/claspignore.test.ts` now fails if any .gs file in this directory is missing below.
**/**
!Code.gs
!auth.gs
!sheets.gs
!setup.gs
!roster.gs
!devices.gs
!clerk.gs
!appsscript.json
